%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 22d0308a90dc49ae97395f1b651723b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_06_RecentBreach
  questionId: CTX-06
  category: 0
  speakerName: Hiring Manager
  questionText: >-
    Midway through discovery, the CISO mentions they had a recent breach and the room gets quiet. What do you do next?
  answerOptions:
  - {fileID: 11400001}
  - {fileID: 11400002}
  - {fileID: 11400003}
  - {fileID: 11400004}
--- !u!114 &11400001
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_06_A1
  answerText: >-
    Pause the pitch, ask what they are comfortable sharing, and separate incident sensitivity from buying criteria.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 1
  rapportDelta: 3
  energyDelta: 0
--- !u!114 &11400002
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_06_A2
  answerText: >-
    Ask for the attack path and map where your controls could have detected or contained it.
  technicalDelta: 3
  commercialDelta: 0
  rapportDelta: -1
  energyDelta: -1
--- !u!114 &11400003
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_06_A3
  answerText: >-
    Say this is exactly why they need a platform and move into the incident-response slide.
  technicalDelta: 0
  commercialDelta: 1
  rapportDelta: -2
  energyDelta: 1
--- !u!114 &11400004
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_06_A4
  answerText: >-
    Admit you cannot judge the breach from one sentence, then ask what has to change before the board update.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 2
  rapportDelta: 1
  energyDelta: -1
